<title>USA: Missouri direct hogs steady/$0.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Missouri direct hogs steady/$0.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and Gilts steady to $0.50 higher than Monday's close. Demand good and Supply moderate to light. Top $59.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    230-260 lbs    58.00-59.50</p>
<p>US 1-2    210-220 lbs    55.00-58.00</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-230 lbs    57.00-58.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    260-270 lbs    57.00-58.00</p>
<p>	    270-280 lbs    56.00-57.00</p>
<p>Sows steady to 1.00 higher. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-500 lbs    43.00-44.00</p>
<p>	   over 500 lbs    45.00-49.00</p>
</text>
